      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从小事开始一步步做起……\n比如说，先试着在训练时引人注目──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1cb44ad5b8a9fe82ceaad0cffb3bd4aec89005dc67bfd1471c52045901221a4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
