    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5474c3ae3eba9cb683911f5a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我深刻地感觉到，\n内向又不喜欢受到注目的荒漠英雄\n正在努力克服自己的弱点……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "232c36c4f66291476fa3f4485ae5608adcd4c02d9c305f33e3379787ef58ecf5",
